  "content": "With the zero-day, ShinyHunters claims to have compromised more than 300 PeopleSoft instances across more than 100 organizations. In a blog post , researchers from Mandiant and GTIG said they alerted more than 100 organizations with potentially vulnerable endpoints. In an email to Dark Reading, Dustin Childs, head of threat awareness for Trend Micro's Zero Day Initiative, characterizes the exploitation as \"limited,\" though notes that the investigation by TrendAI, Trend Micro's enterprise security division, is still ongoing.",
